# 洛谷 P2261 [CQOI2007] 余数求和

题意: 计算

$$
G(n, k) = \sum_{i = 1} ^ {n} {k \space mod \space i}
$$

思路:

$$
a \bmod b = a - \lfloor a/b \rfloor \cdot b \\
\sum_{i=1}^{n} k \bmod i = \sum_{i=1}^{n} (k - \lfloor k/i \rfloor) \cdot i = n \cdot k - \sum_{i=1}^{n} \lfloor k/i \rfloor \cdot i
$$

不同的k/i的值大概有sqrt(k)个, 要问为什么, em..., 可以打表看看

对于一个最小的l, 使得, k/l=t, 要再求最大的r使得, k/r=t, 这个也许可以用二分来求, 但是更好的方法是运算, 注意到t\*r<=k, r<=k/t, 所以直接r=k/t

代码:

```cpp
#include <bits/stdc++.h>
using namespace std;
#define ll long long
#define db(x) cerr << #x << " = " << (x) << " "
#define el cerr << endl
#define vt vector
#define rg(x, a, b) (x).begin() + a, (x).begin() + b + 1
#define sz(x) int((x).size())
#define pii pair<int, int>
#define pll pair<ll, ll>
#define pb push_back
#define all(x) (x).begin(), (x).end()
#define fi first
#define se second
#define p_queue priority_queue

int main() {
    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);
    cin.tie(0);
    ll n, k;
    cin >> n >> k;
    ll ans = n * k;
    for (ll l = 1, r; l <= n; l = r + 1) {
        ll t = k / l;
        if (t) r = min(k / t, n);
        else r = n;
        ans -= (l + r) * (r - l + 1) / 2 * t;
    }
    cout << ans << "\n";
    return 0;
}
```

# Codeforces Round 1079 (Div. 2)

## D

题意: 对于一个数组a, 找到所有的(i, j)满足a[i] \* a[j] == j - i

思路: 其实我在赛时过了这道题, 但是我觉得显然是数据集太弱了, 我的做法是错的. a[i] \* a[j] == j - i可以看出j - i是a[i]和a[j]的倍数, 那么可以分成两种情况

1. a[i] _ a[j] == k _ a[i]

j - i = k \* a[i]

j = k \* a[i] + i

a[i] _ a[k _ a[i] + i] == k \* a[i]

2. a[i] _ a[j] == k _ a[j]

a[j - k _ a[j]] _ a[j] == k \* a[j]

其实这两种情况是同一种情况, 只是枚举的方式不同, 可以看到对于第一种情况, k就是a[j], 只考虑a[j] <= a[i]的情况, k最多只需要枚举到a[i], 第二种情况我们枚举j, 然后再枚举k, 这里的k就是a[i], 现在是a[i] < a[j]的情况, 所以k < a[j]

代码:

```cpp
#include <bits/stdc++.h>
using namespace std;
#define ll long long
#define db(x) cerr << #x << " = " << (x) << " "
#define el cerr << endl
#define vt vector
#define rg(x, a, b) (x).begin() + a, (x).begin() + b + 1
#define sz(x) int((x).size())
#define pii pair<int, int>
#define pll pair<ll, ll>
#define pb push_back
#define all(x) (x).begin(), (x).end()
#define fi first
#define se second
#define p_queue priority_queue

void solve() {
    int n;
    cin >> n;
    vt<int> a(n + 5);
    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
        cin >> a[i];
    }
    ll ans = 0;
    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
        // a[j] == k
        // a[j] <= a[i]
        for (int k = 1; k <= a[j] && k * a[i] + i <= n; k++) {
            int j = k * a[i] + i;
            if (a[j] == k) {
                ans++;
            }
        }
    }
    // a[i] < a[j]
    for (int j = 1; j <= n; j++) {
        for (int k = 1; k < a[j] && j - k * a[j] >= 1; k++) {
            int i = j - k * a[j];
            if (a[i] == k) {
                ans++;
            }
        }
    }
    cout << ans << "\n";
}

int main() {
    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);
    cin.tie(0);
    // a[i] * a[j] = k * a[i]
    // a[i] * a[j] = k * a[j]
    int tt;
    cin >> tt;
    while (tt--) {
        solve();
    }
    return 0;
}
```

